'''Higher-level minds manage subpolities and ordinary affiliates defer, so the control best guess emphasizes hierarchical provider authority. The unusually wide interval retains a concentrated human-derived alternative because ruler origins are mixed. The high nonworking scenario permits extensive recreation and transformation while counting useful world design, research, teaching and care-like roles. Private play alone is not automatically work, and digital embodiment does not make everyone idle. Only active human-derived affiliates form the proxy, excluding dormant identities and extra bodies. Maintained computronium establishes a concrete support mechanism, while unspecified processing entitlements and differing subpolities continue to qualify security.''',
