'''Curators originate as artificial museum and archive minds and retain overarching authority, even where local governments allow extensive voting. Light rule and commercial choice therefore do not erase high-level AI dependency. The modest nonworking best guess counts sustained commercial, curatorial, exploratory, technical and care roles. Private collecting or merely making a purchase is not automatically work. The wide interval concerns active human-derived residents, excluding inactive records and every artificial trading agent. Mature basic access remains compatible with unequal opportunities above the floor and losses on speculative expeditions. This collector-provider hierarchy is not equated with a uniformly self-governing free market.''',
